#
# Local chain (tasalli-verified) ka repo roop: local patch_v461.py
# (sim-meer2) ko STAGE_RM me VERBATIM embedded kiya gaya hai — stage
# ka logic, anchors, asserts aur strip-back proof bilkul wahi jo
# local built-v461-final.html (MD5 e4772e5af73320ccc2bce380ccbe03a7)
# banane me istemal hue.
#
# FIX (Hamza, 2026-10-26 ~16:55 PKT): "Ye video 31 second ki kiun hae
# bari kiun nai" — Rusty Single Journey 31s ki bani, 3 min honi chahiye
# thi. Wajah: journeyV3Inner me lines chup chaap skip ho jati theen
# jab unke clips download na hon (if(!advOk(clip)||usedJ[clip]){
# continue; }) — fresh install + slow Jazz net par 15-min wait me
